# Palette 2, format 2 (crates/render/FORMAT.md 3.2.1): ramps of 6 colors, dark -> light.
# Color 0 is the outline shade of the ramp, 1-4 are auto shading, 5 is the highlight.
# Shadows lean cold (blue, violet), lights lean warm (yellow, orange).
# Ramps 0-19 and materials 0-12 keep the names and indices of palette 1: devnet characters store
# these indices. Append only.
palette 2
outline #120c16

ramp gray      #141219 #2b2a33 #47464f #6b6a70 #9a978f #cfcbbf
ramp steel     #10121b #252b3a #3d4757 #5e6a79 #8e98a0 #cdd2cc
